# Example environment variables for FinanLook

This file lists the environment variables required to run FinanLook locally or in a host like Lovable Cloud.

COPY this file to `.env` (for local dev) and fill the values. Do NOT commit actual secrets.

# Supabase (client)
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=

# Supabase (server) - optional server/service keys used on the server side
SUPABASE_URL=
SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=

# Node env
NODE_ENV=development
